{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2015-common-biology-10","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2015,"subject":"biology","number":10,"points":2,"unitId":"metabolism","unitLabel":"에너지 대사","topic":"포도당신생·피루브산·포도당대사","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["metabolism","renal"],"stem":"그림 (가)와 (나)는 사람의 간세포에서 에탄올과 포도당 대사 \n과정의 일부를 각각 나타낸 것이다.\n(가)\n(나)\n술을 마시지 않은 다음날 아침 식사 전과 비교하여 술을 과음한 \n다음날 아침 식사 전에 간세포에서 일어나는 대사의 변화로 옳은 \n것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nNADH 가 증가한다.\nㄱ. \n＋\nNAD\nㄴ. 포도당신생합성이 감소한다.\nㄷ. 피루브산이 아세틸-CoA보다 젖산으로 대사되는 비율이 증가\n한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":577,"height":67,"region":0,"bbox":[44.68,54.503,230.8,26.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-common-biology-10/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":454,"height":388,"region":0,"bbox":[43.48,102.103,181.6,155.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-common-biology-10/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":269,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,342.503,310.4,107.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-common-biology-10/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":6,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.297,759.1,633.562],"width":328.98,"height":481.265,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[44.68,54.503,230.8,26.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[43.48,